* Rebuilt and executed **Guide 04 (Offensive Testing & Detection Validation)** from Kali Linux (`192.168.56.101`) against `Win-DC01` (`192.168.56.10`):
  * **Reconnaissance:** Enumerated `DC-COMPANY` (`Company.local`), verifying enforced SMB signing (`signing:True`), disabled SMBv1, blocked anonymous share enumeration (`STATUS_ACCESS_DENIED`), and `ANONYMOUS LOGON` protocol behavior.
